save(78,dict(paragraphs=["Mamata Pattnaik writes poetry in Odia, alongside stories, reviews and essays on language and literature. Srujan’s 2021 contributor note places her in Bhubaneswar and records a writing life that extends from literary periodicals to programmes on All India Radio and Doordarshan. Her poem ‘Shabda’ appeared in that journal, considering the creative and destructive possibilities of words.","In Kabita Live’s ‘ଉପେକ୍ଷାର ଋତୁ’, broken trust becomes a landscape of shattered images, fire and scars. The speaker answers estrangement by gathering the pieces of the self, turning away from the contest of defeating others. The poem’s movement towards rebuilding gives its anger and hurt a quietly resolute ending."],sources=[source('Srujan — 2021, volume 1, issue 2, pages 30–32','https://instituteofinsight.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Srujan-v1-i2-211227.pdf',['Shabda by Mamata Pattnaik; Bhubaneswar; stories, reviews and literary essays; All India Radio and Doordarshan programmes; biography matches captured 1000-plus poems and five collections'],'opened_pdf_text')],identity_match='Exact Odia name in contents; contributor note shares distinctive combination of 1000-plus published poems, five collections and electronic media activity with captured biography. Supports same writer beyond name. Edition poem94 explicitly has writer_id78 and matching author; both rendered reciprocal links confirmed despite empty captured works list.',poems_read=[dict(id=94,title='ଉପେକ୍ଷାର ଋତୁ',basis='Full original Odia edition text; fractured trust, lac-palace fire, scars and rebuilding oneself.'),dict(title='ଶବ୍ଦ',basis='Srujan pp30–32 extracted text read; creative/destructive speech motif only, no quotations or reconstruction from imperfect extraction.')],limitations=['Captured biography ends abruptly at She; preserved without reconstruction.','PDF text extraction has Odia glyph errors; page screenshot retrieval unavailable. No uncertain names of books or awards used.','Historical numerical publication claims omitted from reader narrative; no verified individual book titles or links.'],research_leads=[dict(query='Mamata Pattnaik / Pattanaik poet; ମମତା ପଟ୍ଟନାୟକ',url='https://manananatyasanstha.com/productions.aspx',access='search_index_excerpt',finding='Mamata Bebarta Pattnaik found; not merged without evidence connecting extended name.'),dict(url='https://in.linkedin.com/in/mamatapattanaik',access='search_index_excerpt',finding='Name-only professional match excluded.')],next_action='Editor review of biography and book bibliography; original capture and contribution links preserved.'))
